### Summary of every change

| File | What changed |
|------|-------------|
| `Cargo.toml` | Added `license`, `readme`, `repository`, `homepage`, `keywords`, `categories` — all required / strongly recommended for `cargo publish` |
| `src/main.rs` | Entry point: parses CLI and dispatches to `generate_config` or `run` |
| `src/config.rs` | Typed, `serde`-derived structs for `config.toml`; `Config::load()` reads and parses the file |
| `src/runner.rs` | `Runner` struct: prints each command in colour, prompts for confirmation (skipped with `-y`), retries automatically with `sudo` on non-zero exit |
| `src/install.rs` | `generate_config` writes the scaffold; `run` orchestrates the three installers; `install_runc`, `install_cni`, `install_containerd` implement the step-by-step flows from the README |
| `LICENSE` | MIT licence required by `cargo publish` |
| `.github/workflows/ci.yml` | Runs `check`, `clippy`, `fmt --check`, `test`, and a release build on every push/PR |
